\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\insrsid5580424 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 Quick summary}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\insrsid5580424 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 - Upload Excel via the UI or POST /api/upload-excel -> server converts to JSON in src/data.
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 - Create embeddings with POST /api/create-embeddings (per-file) or POST /api/create-embeddings-batch (batch scripts) -> documents inserted into MongoDB.
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 - Monitor b\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 ackground jobs via GET /api/jobs/active and GET /api/jobs/:jobId.
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 - Perform searches after embeddings & Atlas Search indexes exist using the search endpoints.
\par 
