\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37    - Client uploads Excel (.xlsx/.xls).
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37    - Endpo\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 int: POST /api/upload-excel
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37    - Inputs: multipart/form-data fields: file, dataType (testcases or userstories), sheetName (optional)
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37    - Output: JSON file written under src/data/ (filename returned in response).
\par 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 2. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\insrsid5580424 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 Create embeddings}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\insrsid5580424 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37    - Single-file embe\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 ddings:
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37      - Endpoint: POST /api/create-embeddings
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37      - Body:  "files": ["converted-<timestamp>.json"] 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37      - Server creates a job and runs a per-file child process that reads JSON, calls the embedding utility, and inserts documents into MongoDB.
\par 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37    \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 - Batch embeddings (preferred for large imports):
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37      - Endpoint: POST /api/create-embeddings-batch
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37      - Body:  "files": [...], "scriptName": "<script.js>", "jobType": "<label>" 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37      - Runs scripts in src/scripts/embeddings/ with env EMBEDDING_INPUT_FI\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 LES.
\par 
